msgctxt "help:gnuhealth.hospital.bed,calendar:"
msgid ""
"A calendar can be associated to a bed. To use this functionality, it needs "
"to be created via health -> calendars"
msgstr ""
"Se puede asociar un calendario a una cama. Para utilizar esta funcionalidad,"
" es necesario crearla a través de salud -> calendarios"

msgctxt "help:gnuhealth.inpatient.registration,event:"
msgid "Calendar Event associated to this hospitalization"
msgstr "Evento del calendario asociado a esta hospitalización"
